### List available export formats
GET http://localhost:5000/api/export

###

### Export as CSV
GET http://localhost:5000/api/export/csv

###

### Export as JSON
GET http://localhost:5000/api/export/json

###

### Export as XML
GET http://localhost:5000/api/export/xml

###

### Export as Markdown table
GET http://localhost:5000/api/export/markdown

###

### Export using generic route — CSV
GET http://localhost:5000/api/export/csv

###

### Export using generic route — JSON
GET http://localhost:5000/api/export/json

###

### Export using generic route — unsupported format (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/export/pdf
